-- THE COST OF WIDENING `.*`, ASSERTED.  Two wildcard imports both bind `Speak`,
-- so naming it is ambiguous — exactly as it is for the selective spelling of the
-- same two imports.  A wildcard that does not carry interfaces answers a
-- different question here (`Unknown interface: Speak`), so this row is what
-- distinguishes "the name is missing" from "the name is here twice".
import ia.*
import ib.*

shout : Speak a => a -> Int
shout _ = 1
